<view class="container">
  <view class="card plan-tools-card" bindtap="goToFueler">
    <view class="row">
      <view>
        <view class="tool-kicker">智能备赛工具箱</view>
        <view class="tool-title">PB能量舱</view>
        <view class="tool-sub">配速、补给、撞墙风险模拟推演</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tool-arrow">进入</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="hero-card hero-accent">
    <view class="hero-title">{{activeTemplateName}}</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">起始日期：{{startDate}}</view>
    <view class="metrics-row">
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-label">周期</view>
        <view class="metric-value">{{weekCountText}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-label">已完成</view>
        <view class="metric-value">{{doneCountText}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-label">总公里</view>
        <view class="metric-value">{{totalDistanceText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="progress-wrap">
      <view class="progress-bar" style="width: {{completionBarWidth}};"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card panel-card">
    <view class="section-title">计划设置</view>
    <view class="setting-grid">
      <view class="setting-item">
        <view class="setting-label">训练计划</view>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{templateNames}}" value="{{templateIndex}}" bindchange="onTemplateChange">
          <view class="picker-box">{{templateNames[templateIndex] || "请选择模板"}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="setting-item">
        <view class="setting-label">起始日期</view>
        <picker mode="date" start="{{minStartDate}}" value="{{startDate}}" bindchange="onStartDateChange">
          <view class="picker-box">{{startDate}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="safety-tip">
      温馨提示：半马是“耐力基础上拼速度”，全马是“海量有氧底盘上拼续航”。全马负荷较高，建议具备1年以上规律跑步基础，且近3个月月跑量稳定在150km及以上后再参赛。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card panel-card">
    <view class="row taper-head" bindtap="toggleTaperGuide">
      <view class="section-title">赛前减量指南</view>
      <view class="fold-text">{{taperGuideVisible ? "收起" : "展开"}}</view>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{taperGuideVisible}}">
      <view class="taper-dialog">
        <view class="taper-line">1、核心九字原则：减总量、保强度、保频率。总跑量降至日常40%-60%（缩短长距离与单次时长）；强度课保留配速、缩短组数/距离；维持原有跑步频率，保留肌肉记忆与节奏。</view>
        <view class="taper-line">2、减量周期划分：</view>
        <view class="taper-line">半马：赛前7-10天启动，侧重保留半马配速体感。</view>
        <view class="taper-line">全马常规：赛前14天启动；大跑量/深疲劳跑者：赛前21天启动，彻底释放深层疲劳。</view>
        <view class="taper-line">3、关键提醒：减量不断崖、不躺平，以腿轻、精神好为标准，宁少勿多，保障赛前最佳状态。</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="card panel-card week-card" wx:for="{{weeks}}" wx:key="week" wx:for-item="weekItem">
    <view class="row week-header" data-week="{{weekItem.week}}" bindtap="toggleWeek">
      <view>
        <view class="week-title">第{{weekItem.week}}周</view>
        <view class="muted">{{weekItem.phase || "训练期"}} · 周里程 {{weekItem.weekly_km}} km</view>
      </view>
      <view class="row">
        <text wx:if="{{weekItem.is_deload_week}}" class="week-tag">减量周</text>
        <text class="fold-text">{{activeWeek === weekItem.week ? "收起" : "展开"}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{activeWeek === weekItem.week}}" class="session-list">
      <view
        class="session-item"
        wx:for="{{weekItem.sessions}}"
        wx:key="day_index"
        wx:for-item="session"
        data-week="{{weekItem.week}}"
        data-dayindex="{{session.day_index}}"
        bindtap="toggleSession"
      >
        <view class="row">
          <view class="session-title">{{session.day_label}} · {{session.workout_type || "恢复训练"}}</view>
          <view class="{{session.completed ? 'status-done' : 'status-todo'}}">{{session.completed ? "已完成" : "待完成"}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="session-desc">{{session.description || session.segment || "按计划执行"}}</view>
        <view class="session-meta">
          <text>{{session.distanceText}}</text>
          <text>{{session.paceText}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
